   c. Any publicly accessible store page, website, or promotional material for the Product.

6.2 Attribution Format
The attribution must be clearly legible, displayed in a font size and style comparable to other credits, and must include at minimum the following text:

   "Powered by [Software Name] © Pixelated Dream / Raven Studios"

   Where [Software Name] shall be replaced with the official name of the Software as designated by Pixelated Dream / Raven Studios.

6.3 Exception for Internal Use
The attribution requirement does not apply to Products developed and distributed solely by Pixelated Dream or Raven Studios for their own internal or commercial purposes.

